---
// 工具箱卡片。工具都是独立页面，新标签页打开。
---
<div class="tool-shelf">
  <a
    class="tool tool-feature"
    href="/tools/image-compressor/"
    target="_blank"
    rel="noopener noreferrer"
    aria-label="打开图片压缩工具（新标签页）"
  >
    <div class="tool-pv" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="tp-window">
        <div class="tp-bar">
          <span class="tp-dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
          <span class="tp-title">image-compressor / local</span>
          <span class="tp-live"><i></i>READY</span>
        </div>
        <div class="tp-content">
          <div class="tp-controls">
            <div class="tp-field"><span>QUALITY</span><span class="tp-num">80%</span></div>
            <div class="tp-slider"><i></i></div>
            <div class="tp-field"><span>FORMAT</span><span class="tp-num">WebP</span></div>
            <div class="tp-field"><span>SIZE</span><span class="tp-num">1920 px</span></div>
            <div class="tp-action">开始压缩</div>
          </div>
          <div class="tp-files">
            <div class="tp-file">
              <span class="tp-thumb tp-thumb-a"></span>
              <span class="tp-lines"><i></i><i></i></span>
              <span class="tp-save">&minus;68%</span>
            </div>
            <div class="tp-file">
              <span class="tp-thumb tp-thumb-b"></span>
              <span class="tp-lines"><i></i><i></i></span>
              <span class="tp-save">&minus;74%</span>
            </div>
            <div class="tp-file">
              <span class="tp-thumb tp-thumb-c"></span>
              <span class="tp-lines"><i></i><i></i></span>
              <span class="tp-save">&minus;52%</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="tool-body">
      <div class="tool-kicker">PYODIDE · PILLOW · WASM</div>
      <h2 class="tool-name">图片压缩</h2>
      <p class="tool-desc">批量压缩 JPG / PNG / GIF / WebP。调质量、改尺寸、换格式，一键打包下载。文件只在浏览器里处理，不上传服务器。</p>
      <div class="tool-meta">
        <span>本地运行 · 免登录</span>
        <span class="tool-open">打开工具
          <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 4h6v6M20 4l-9 9M18 14v5a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H5a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V7a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5"/></svg>
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </a>
</div>
<p class="tool-note">每个工具独立成页，在新标签页打开。更多小工具还在路上。</p>
